 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "play / go / do + 운동",
   "en": "play / go / do + sports"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "공을 쓰는 운동에는 play: play football, play tennis. -ing로 끝나는 운동에는 go: go swimming, go running. 요가나 태권도 같은 운동에는 do: do yoga. he / she에는 plays, goes, does를 씁니다.",
   "en": "Use play with ball sports: play football, play tennis. Use go with sports that end in -ing: go swimming, go running. Use do with activities like yoga. With he / she use plays, goes, does."
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "표현 / Pattern",
    "예 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "play + 구기",
     "I play football."
    ],
    [
     "go + -ing",
     "I go swimming."
    ],
    [
     "do + 활동",
     "I do yoga."
    ],
    [
     "he / she",
     "plays, goes, does"
    ]
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   {
    "ko": "play 뒤에는 the를 쓰지 않아요: play football.",
    "en": "Don't use the after play: play football."
   },
   {
    "ko": "go swimming에서 go는 he / she에 goes가 됩니다.",
    "en": "In go swimming, go becomes goes with he / she."
   },
   {
    "ko": "do 뒤에는 요가, 수영 같은 활동이 와요.",
    "en": "After do come activities like yoga."
   }
  ],
  "examples": [
